					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">I just talked to DV for a while - looking like the trial is actually going to happen at the end of the month. The cops have been investigated and won&#039;t be charged which is bullshit. We all are going to need to write in support of DV, and show up in force. I should have an update from DV with details today or tomorrow.<br /><br /></div>
