					<hr size="2" width="100%" />
					Title: <b>Re: SUPPORT DV ONE - TRIAL DATE SET</b><br />
					Post by: <b>DVOne</b> on <b>August 28, 2007, 03:06:37 am</b>
					<hr />
					<div style="margin: 0 5ex;">SPREAD THE WORD!<br /><br /> <br /><br />DV ONE TRIAL BEGINS<br />August 30, 2007<br />COME AND SHOW YOUR SUPPORT!!!<br /><br />The DV One Trial is to begin this week on Thursday, August 30, 2007 at<br /> 9am. <br /><br />The trial itself is scheduled to last 5 days. However, there is NO<br /> COURT on<br />Friday, August 31, 2007 and Monday, September 3, 2007.<br /><br />The dates look like this:<br /><br />Pre Trial - August 28, 2007<br />Trial Dates: Thursday, August 30, 2007<br />Tuesday, September 4, 2007<br />Wednesday, September 5, 2007<br />Thursday, September 6, 2007<br />Monday, September 10, 2007<br /><br />The message is simple....COME OUT AND SUPPORT!<br /><br />this means come sit in the court room, watch the trial, hear witness and police testimony.<br />i need as many people there as possible. its always been about accountability, we as a <br />community need to be conscious, and aware. The more eyes that are on this case, the less room<br />there is for error. Please show support by being there.<br /><br /> <br /><br />King County Courthouse: Judge Washington <br />Room: W864<br /><br />The court location is at:<br />King County Courthouse<br />516 - 3rd Avenue<br />Seattle, WA 98104<br />Phone: (206) 296-9100<br />Fax: (206) 296-0986<br />TTY: (206) 205-5048</div>
